{"_id":"03f7da4c0cd835f0","name":"Orcish Madu","type":"armor","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"category":"Shields","description":"Though tiny, this round shield is fitted with large horns or tusks. When using the Shield Bash technick, this shield deals +1 die of damage. Additionally, this shield deals piercing damage rather than blunt damage. Medium creatures may treat this as either a 1-handed or light shield.","cost":1300,"availability":"Common","weaponSize":"Tiny","weaponSkill":"light-weapon","attack":{"bonus":1},"damage":{"formula":"","type":"Blunt"},"armorType":"shield","bulk":0.1,"specialRules":"Though tiny, this round shield is fitted with large horns or tusks. When using the Shield Bash technick, this shield deals +1 die of damage. Additionally, this shield deals piercing damage rather than blunt damage. Medium creatures may treat this as either a 1-handed or light shield."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"ac03033a4d2111c0","name":"Aspis","type":"armor","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"category":"Shields","description":"A large round shield of ancient make, favoured by soldiers of old when using phalanx formations. When fighting defensively, you may reroll block attempts, keeping the second result, even if worse.","cost":2100,"availability":"Rare","weaponSize":"Large","weaponSkill":"two-handed","attack":{"bonus":1},"damage":{"formula":"","type":"Blunt"},"armorType":"shield","bulk":2,"specialRules":"A large round shield of ancient make, favoured by soldiers of old when using phalanx formations. When fighting defensively, you may reroll block attempts, keeping the second result, even if worse."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
