{"_id":"3840bdafdc322956","name":"Flame Shield","type":"armor","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"category":"Shields","description":"Forged to resemble a burning flame, this shield is adorned with blazing crystals. You may reroll block attempts against attacks and spells that deal fire damage, keeping the higher result. When using the Shield Bash technick, this shield’s","cost":15700,"availability":"Rare","weaponSize":"Small","weaponSkill":"light-weapon","attack":{"bonus":3},"damage":{"formula":"","type":"Blunt"},"armorType":"shield","bulk":0.1,"specialRules":"Forged to resemble a burning flame, this shield is adorned with blazing crystals. You may reroll block attempts against attacks and spells that deal fire damage, keeping the higher result. When using the Shield Bash technick, this shield’s"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"23f5c3534f0a92be","name":"Mirror Shield","type":"armor","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"category":"Shields","description":"This round shield has a magickal mirror on its face. You gain a 20% chance (20 or less on d%) to not be affected by a spell, including spells cast by allies. This percentage stacks with that provided from mirror mail.","cost":18300,"availability":"Exotic","weaponSize":"Tiny","weaponSkill":"light-weapon","attack":{"bonus":4},"damage":{"formula":"","type":"Blunt"},"armorType":"shield","bulk":0.1,"specialRules":"This round shield has a magickal mirror on its face. You gain a 20% chance (20 or less on d%) to not be affected by a spell, including spells cast by allies. This percentage stacks with that provided from mirror mail."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"092c9cf5aba21476","name":"Ogre Shield","type":"armor","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"category":"Shields","description":"This intimidating shield appears to grant the wielder greater strength when bashing. When using the Shield Bash technick, this shield deals +1 die of damage. Additionally, you may reroll natural 1s on block attempts, until a natural 2 or higher is achieved.","cost":21100,"availability":"Exotic","weaponSize":"Large","weaponSkill":"two-handed","attack":{"bonus":4},"damage":{"formula":"","type":"Blunt"},"armorType":"shield","bulk":2,"specialRules":"This intimidating shield appears to grant the wielder greater strength when bashing. When using the Shield Bash technick, this shield deals +1 die of damage. Additionally, you may reroll natural 1s on block attempts, until a natural 2 or higher is achieved."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"f87c371313e4a566","name":"Daemon Shield","type":"armor","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"category":"Shields","description":"Forged using the heart of a daemon, this shield is a vessel of corruption. You may reroll block attempts against attacks and spells that deal holy damage, keeping the higher result. Successful blocks against melee attacks cause the attacker to suffer an amount of unaspected damage equal to half the damage they would have dealt to you. When using the Shield Bash technick, this shield’s damage is treated as dark against enemies immune, resistant, or weak to dark damage.","cost":24100,"availability":"Epic","weaponSize":"Medium","weaponSkill":"one-handed","attack":{"bonus":4},"damage":{"formula":"","type":"Blunt"},"armorType":"shield","bulk":1,"specialRules":"Forged using the heart of a daemon, this shield is a vessel of corruption. You may reroll block attempts against attacks and spells that deal holy damage, keeping the higher result. Successful blocks against melee attacks cause the attacker to suffer an amount of unaspected damage equal to half the damage they would have dealt to you. When using the Shield Bash technick, this shield’s damage is treated as dark against enemies immune, resistant, or weak to dark damage."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"27ad8996988cf241","name":"Svalinn","type":"armor","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"category":"Shields","description":"This legendary shield, forged by a great battle between the Primals, protected the ancient races from destruction. You may reroll block attempts against attacks and spells that deal cold, electric, or fire damage, keeping the higher result. Additionally, Svalinn may be used to block attacks and spells that target any defence.","cost":27300,"availability":"Legendary","weaponSize":"Medium","weaponSkill":"one-handed","attack":{"bonus":5},"damage":{"formula":"","type":"Blunt"},"armorType":"shield","bulk":1,"specialRules":"This legendary shield, forged by a great battle between the Primals, protected the ancient races from destruction. You may reroll block attempts against attacks and spells that deal cold, electric, or fire damage, keeping the higher result. Additionally, Svalinn may be used to block attacks and spells that target any defence."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"75837bdd74b9dfd1","name":"Pridwen","type":"armor","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"category":"Shields","description":"This blessed kite shield is one of the 9 divine artefacts. You may reroll block attempts against attacks and spells that deal dark damage, keeping the higher result. Additionally, at the start of your turn, you gain 10 temporary HP. Damage is subtracted from this HP first, and remains until the start of your next turn. When using the Shield Bash technick, Pridwen’s damage is treated as holy against enemies immune, resistant, or weak to holy damage. Evil creatures may not utilize Pridwen’s special qualities.","cost":30700,"availability":"Legendary","weaponSize":"Large","weaponSkill":"two-handed","attack":{"bonus":5},"damage":{"formula":"","type":"Blunt"},"armorType":"shield","bulk":2,"specialRules":"This blessed kite shield is one of the 9 divine artefacts. You may reroll block attempts against attacks and spells that deal dark damage, keeping the higher result. Additionally, at the start of your turn, you gain 10 temporary HP. Damage is subtracted from this HP first, and remains until the start of your next turn. When using the Shield Bash technick, Pridwen’s damage is treated as holy against enemies immune, resistant, or weak to holy damage. Evil creatures may not utilize Pridwen’s special qualities."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
